{"title": "Legendary Action: Sanguine Lash", "pageid": 30846, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Sanguine_Lash", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp, /w/images/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Legendary Action: Sanguine Lash</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Passive_feature\" title=\"Passive feature\">passive feature</a> available to <a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin</a>, that lets her use <a href=\"/wiki/Sanguine_Lash\" title=\"Sanguine Lash\">Sanguine Lash</a> after being attacked, or places <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Edict_(Condition)\" title=\"Bhaal's Edict (Condition)\">Bhaal's Edict</a> on a creature if she does not. Although the in-game text does not mention it, Orin will only activate this attack against foes who hit her with <i>melee</i> attacks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per round, Orin can use her Legendary Action to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sanguine_Lash\" title=\"Sanguine Lash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Physical_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Physical_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Physical_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sanguine Lash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Physical_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sanguine_Lash\" title=\"Sanguine Lash\">Sanguine Lash</a> after being attacked. \n</p><p>If Orin does not use her Legendary Action in a round and is not dueling her opponent alone, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Edict_(Condition)\" title=\"Bhaal's Edict (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bhaal's Edict\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Edict_(Condition)\" title=\"Bhaal's Edict (Condition)\">Bhaal's Edict</a> is placed on a creature.\n</p><p><span style=\"color: white;\">Legendary Actions restore at the start of each round.</span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Legendary_Action:_Sanguine_Lash\"> Condition: Legendary Action: Sanguine Lash </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Sanguine_Lash_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Sanguine Lash (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Sanguine Lash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Sanguine_Lash_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Sanguine Lash (Condition)\">Legendary Action: Sanguine Lash</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Orin can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sanguine_Lash\" title=\"Sanguine Lash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Physical_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Physical_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Physical_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sanguine Lash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Physical_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sanguine_Lash\" title=\"Sanguine Lash\">Sanguine Lash</a> after being attacked.</li>\n<li>If Orin does not use her Legendary Action in a round, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Edict_(Condition)\" title=\"Bhaal's Edict (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bhaal's Edict\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Edict_(Condition)\" title=\"Bhaal's Edict (Condition)\">Bhaal's Edict</a> is placed on a creature.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p><i>(Information not yet added.)</i>\n</p>\n</div>      \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Although the text does not mention it, Orin will only activate this attack against foes who hit her with <i>melee</i> attacks.</li>\n<li>The party should be wary of standing too near the edge of the abyss, as this attack can potentially send multiple party members to their deaths.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200807\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1312/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 14166/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5743/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 639920/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.771      1 -total\n 98.72%   43.210      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 27.34%   11.967      3 Template:Icon_link\n 26.31%   11.514      3 Template:Icon_text\n 22.55%    9.870      8 Template:Trim\n 21.77%    9.530      1 Template:SAI\n 16.76%    7.337      3 Template:Ifempty\n 16.17%    7.077      1 Template:Cond\n 15.91%    6.962      1 Template:Con